# Paste your signed-in YouTube cookies (Netscape cookies.txt format — the whole
# file, e.g. everything from YOUTUBE_COOKIE in the old web backend) here to
# bypass YouTube's bot detection on device.
#
# For the EAS APK build, create a build-env secret instead of committing this:
#   npx eas-cli secret:create --name EXPO_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_COOKIE --value "<cookies content>"
#
# Local dev (expo start): fill this file, it is git-ignored.
EXPO_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_COOKIE=